  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]  [Am]\n[Dm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]Lyin' in my\nplastic bed, Thinkin'\n[Am]how things weren't so coo-\nl to me. My\n[A#]baby likes\nto shoot pool,\n[F]I like lyin' naked\nin my bedroom.\n[F#]Tyin' on the di-\nnosaur toni-\n[C#]ght, It used to be\nso cool.\n\n[Chorus]\n[E/B]Now I've got the nee-\n[B]dle, And I can sha-\n[E/B]but I can't\n[B]I take it awa-\n[E/B]y, but I want more and mo-\n[B]re.\n[F#/C#]One day I'm gonna\nlose the war.\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F#m]Lyin' in my\nplastic bed, Thinkin'\n[C#m/G#]how things weren't so coo-\nl to me. My\n[D/A]baby likes\nto shoot pool,\n[A]I like lyin' naked\nin my bedroom.\n[A#]Tyin' on the di-\nnosaur toni-\n[F/C]ght, It used to be\nso cool.\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#/C#]Now I've got the nee-\n[C#]dle, And I can sha-\n[F#/C#]ke, but I can't\n[C#]breath. I take it awa-\n[F#/C#]y, but I want more and mo-\n[C#]re.\n\n[Outro]\n[G#/D#]One day I'm gonna\nlose the war. [Em]",
